sequenceDiagram
    participant PaymentControls
    participant SNSTopic as SNS Topic
    participant SNS
    participant Rails as Rails  (e.g. LHV Rails)
    participant Provider as Provider (e.g. LHV)
    participant SNSPublisher as SNS Publisher

    PaymentControls->>SNSTopic: CheckoutApprovalAccepted event
    Note over SNSTopic: Event contains RoutingKey message attribute

    SNSTopic->>SNS: Filter by RoutingKey prefix e.g. "Provider"
    Note over SNS: SNS subscription filters for<br/>RoutingKey prefix of Provider

    SNS->>Rails: CheckoutApprovalAccepted event
    Note over Provider: Receives filtered event<br/>with Provider RoutingKey

    Rails->>Provider: Process payout request
    Note over Provider: External Provider processes<br/>the payout request

    alt ProviderRails Scenarios
        alt Payout Return
            Provider->>Rails: Payout return response
            Rails->>SNSTopic: PayoutReturnReceived event
        else Payout Rejection
            Provider->>Rails: Payout rejection response
            Rails->>SNSTopic: PayoutRejectionReceived event
        else Payout Dispatched
            Provider->>Rails: Payout dispatched response
            Rails->>SNSTopic: PayoutDispatchedReceived event
        else Payout Confirmation
            Provider->>Rails: Payout confirmation response
            Rails->>SNSTopic: PayoutConfirmationReceived event
        end
    end
